  "solution": "The logic followed here is:\n\n1333-1730-2199-2746-3377\n\nsqrt[3]{(1333 - 2)} → sqrt[3]{(1331)} = 11\n\nsqrt[3]{(1730 - 2)} → sqrt[3]{(1728)} = 12\n\nsqrt[3]{(2199 - 2)} → sqrt[3]{(2197)} = 13\n\nsqrt[3]{(2746 - 2)} → sqrt[3]{(2744)} = 14\n\nsqrt[3]{(3377 - 2)} → sqrt[3]{(3375)} = 15\n\nHere, series of \"11-12-13-14-15\" is followed.\n\n \n\nAnd,\n\n218-345-514-731-1002​​​\n\nsqrt[3]{(218 - 2)} → sqrt[3]{(216)} = 6\n\nsqrt[3]{(345 - 2)} → sqrt[3]{(343)} = 7\n\nsqrt[3]{(514 - 2)} → sqrt[3]{(512)} = 8\n\nsqrt[3]{(731 - 2)} → sqrt[3]{(729)} = 9\n\nsqrt[3]{(1002 - 2)} → sqrt[3]{(1000)} = 10\n\nHere, series of \"6 -7 - 8 -9 -10\" is followed.\n\nSimilarly,\n\n3-10-29-66-127\n\nsqrt[3]{(3 - 2)} → sqrt[3]{(1)} = 1\n\nsqrt[3]{(10 - 2)} → sqrt[3]{(8)} = 2\n\nsqrt[3]{(29 - 2)} → sqrt[3]{(27)} = 3\n\nsqrt[3]{(66 - 2)} → sqrt[3]{(64)} = 4\n\nsqrt[3]{(127 - 2)} → sqrt[3]{(125)} = 5\n\nHere, series of \"1-2-3-4-5\" is followed.\n\nHence, the correct answer is \"Option 3\".\n\ndb:T",
